{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A STRANGE PLANET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a procedurally generated, interconnected world. Survive diverse ecosystems full of strange lifeforms. Discover which ones want to eat you, and which ones might help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/dc159a8b6b163deb6d01290592909a71.poster.avif?t=1770926397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/dc159a8b6b163deb6d01290592909a71.webm?t=1770926397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/dc159a8b6b163deb6d01290592909a71.mp4?t=1770926397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER GAME-CHANGING MUTATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you\u2019ll find powerful mutations that change the way you interact with the world. Burrow through earth, glide through the skies, manipulate objects, and more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/218c9ba9f1de19b86ca29ceb93d4d794.poster.avif?t=1770926397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/218c9ba9f1de19b86ca29ceb93d4d794.webm?t=1770926397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/218c9ba9f1de19b86ca29ceb93d4d794.mp4?t=1770926397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR OWN WAY TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is a physics sandbox full of hidden systems and interactions. With each life and death, you'll discover new knowledge about the world to help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/5f15c623cd1a5bd32ee721b644d157b2.poster.avif?t=1770926397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/5f15c623cd1a5bd32ee721b644d157b2.webm?t=1770926397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/extras/5f15c623cd1a5bd32ee721b644d157b2.mp4?t=1770926397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507690?t=1770926397","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/cb61088ebf2bd7f6f7e39dfc8916ca98ac0d10a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770926397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/948c67cb907d98a26b7455edf4b208d159ddf701/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770926397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507690/948c67cb907d98a26b7455edf4b208d159ddf701/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770926397","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A STRANGE PLANET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a procedurally generated, interconnected world. Survive diverse ecosystems full of strange lifeforms. Discover which ones want to eat you, and which ones might help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb